WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.210
In 1914, an Archduke of Austria-Hungary was
shot by a Serbian nationalist.

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:10.230
This led, after a series of nations signing
treaties with other nations, to one of the

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:12.679
bloodiest conflicts ever fought.

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:16.320
A war that was unlike any that had been fought
at the time.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:22.800
Trench combat, mud, and sandbags, newer, deadlier
advancements in the art of warfare, vile,

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:29.500
incurable and fatal diseases, and months upon
months of misery, all while trapped in dark,

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.289
dank dugouts.

00:00:31.289 --> 00:00:36.280
The Great War, the First World War, it’s
gone by many names since its ceasefire in

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:41.210
1918, and while there aren’t many left of
the generation that remembers it, there are

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:45.120
still plenty of scars left on the world that
remind us of the horrors.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:50.610
But there’s one that seems to be keeping
those wounds fresh, reminding us that war

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:57.210
is, indeed, Hell as that rough beast slouches
towards its destination.

00:00:57.210 --> 00:01:03.480
This is SCP-2574, what appears from the outset
to be nothing more than a stone sculpture

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:08.510
of a lion, comprised of sandstone… and living
tissue.

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:14.980
Standing at around twelve meters tall, SCP-2574
is much more than a mere statue.

00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:17.780
In fact, it’s a living creature.

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.900
After all, this is the SCP Foundation we’re
talking about here, where inanimate objects

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:27.910
are rarely inanimate at all, or will at least
possess some form of anomalous properties

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:33.939
setting apart anything ordinary and thus drawing
the interest of the Foundation.

00:01:33.939 --> 00:01:40.500
SCP-2574 is similar in that regard, and not
just for being a living statue creature.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:45.960
For one, the anomaly is capable of movement,
albeit at a gradual rate that only progresses

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:49.299
between three and five kilometers per day.

00:01:49.299 --> 00:01:54.830
Attempts by the Foundation to slow or halt
the movement of SCP-2574 have been so far

00:01:54.830 --> 00:02:00.909
unsuccessful, as it seems that any obstacle
placed in its path are unable to deter it.

00:02:00.909 --> 00:02:05.860
This includes both man-made and naturally
occurring obstructions, meaning there is little

00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:11.620
that can be deployed to keep SCP-2574 physically
contained.

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:16.460
Even if a body of water is in its path, the
entity can swim at a rate of between two and

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:22.690
three kilometers per day, and will normally
either crush or climb over any obstacle on

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:23.690
land.

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:28.220
At the previous annual budgeting meeting,
the top minds of the Foundation’s accounting

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:36.010
department revealed to an infuriated O5 Council
that SCP-2574 had been responsible for an

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:42.159
estimated total of twenty-five point three
million US dollars in damages since its discovery.

00:02:42.159 --> 00:02:46.930
The second most pressing matter raised during
that presentation was the one hundred and

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:52.000
twelve deaths and a further six hundred and
twenty-five injuries the anomaly had also

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:53.000
caused.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:56.900
Despite pleas from the Ethics Committee, the
Foundation accountants were still adamant

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.970
that the cost of damages was more significant.

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:05.840
Now, a number of prevailing questions might
be plaguing you regarding SCP-2574.

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:08.659
For one, what does this creature want?

00:03:08.659 --> 00:03:13.319
If it has freedom of movement and can’t
be physically obstructed by the Foundation,

00:03:13.319 --> 00:03:18.050
then is it just aimlessly wandering free and
causing wanton destruction, or does it have

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:21.819
a specific want or goal it seeks to attain?

00:03:21.819 --> 00:03:27.060
And for another, what does an almost forty-foot-tall
lion have to do with World War One?

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:35.170
Well, it might surprise you to know that SCP-2574
has everything to do with the Great War – literally,

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:36.360
everything.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.750
And as for a goal?

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:43.760
It has one, or rather, it has a specific destination
it seems to be gradually heading towards,

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:48.860
and if it makes it all the way there, it could
spell disaster for the entire globe.

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:53.409
In fact, it could plunge us back into one
of the most devastating conflicts the world

00:03:53.409 --> 00:03:54.840
has ever seen.

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:56.960
Can you guess which one?

00:03:56.960 --> 00:04:02.910
SCP-2574 possesses a wide array of latent
anomalous effects, beyond its general functionality

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:04.360
and movement.

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:10.140
Above the sandstone lion creature, it is constantly
surrounded by a flock of around six thousand

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:11.510
birds of prey.

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:17.470
Any that find themselves flying into the path
of SCP-2574 are assimilated into the growing

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:19.590
flock, designated as SCP-2574-1.

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:28.730
The mass of birds is fixated on attacking
SCP-2574, swooping low to strike at its smooth

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:31.980
muscle tissue with using their beaks and talons.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:38.460
This, however, seems to do little to deter
SCP-2574 from making progress, as the anomaly

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:45.039
constantly regenerates from physical damage
it incurs from SCP-2574-1.

00:04:45.039 --> 00:04:51.620
Perhaps the most notable and noticeable of
SCP-2574’s anomalous properties is the effect

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:56.350
it has on its surroundings as it progresses
toward its destination.

00:04:56.350 --> 00:05:02.800
The area around SCP-2574 will undergo a physical
transformation in response to the presence

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:04.150
of the lion.

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:09.280
This transformation results in the nearby
region temporarily becoming a World War One-era

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.740
combat zone.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:15.860
The ground below becomes riddled with trenches
carved through the earth, thick muddy bogs,

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:19.880
and coiled, razor-sharp nets of barbed wire
litter the area.

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:25.199
The change triggered by SCP-2574 is hardly
just a cosmetic one either.

00:05:25.199 --> 00:05:29.920
The Foundation have observed a number of First
World War-related manifestations that occur

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:34.150
in the wake of SCP-2574.

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:39.319
Man-made land masses like trenches and dugouts
will appear nearby, the front lines reappearing

00:05:39.319 --> 00:05:41.639
after more than a century.

00:05:41.639 --> 00:05:47.910
Weaponry from the era is also present following
the arrival of SCP-2574, and this isn’t

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.300
just limited to firearms.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:55.449
World War One was one of the earliest large-scale
conflicts in history wherein both sides deployed

00:05:55.449 --> 00:06:00.510
aerial attacks through the use of bi-planes,
as well as chemical warfare.

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:04.169
As a result, signs of these can also be found
whenever SCP-2574 is nearby.

00:06:04.169 --> 00:06:13.670
But again, the transformation SCP-2574 brings
about is not just limited to recreating battlefields.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:19.169
What some of you may not know is the Great
War did not so much revolve around a core

00:06:19.169 --> 00:06:23.380
idealistic difference between both sides as
its successor did.

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:29.370
Instead, the First World War was a geopolitical
grudge match between large global superpowers

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:34.040
attempting to make grandiose displays of their
amassed military strength.

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:38.770
The assassination of Archduke Franz Ferdinand
of Austria at the hands of a Serbian extremist

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:44.780
group was the catalyst that set off a chain
reaction of events that ultimately led to

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:45.780
war.

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:52.099
As a result of this, SCP-2574’s anomalous
influence also extends to the social and political

00:06:52.099 --> 00:06:54.620
state of the areas it enters.

00:06:54.620 --> 00:07:00.810
A country that the sandstone leonine entity
enters will suffer a rapid change in its local

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:02.490
population’s mentality.

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:07.020
The ordinary people living there will start
to experience a great degree of discontent

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:11.310
towards their government, while the ruling
powers of said country will increase its use

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:14.180
of force against its own civilians.

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:19.449
This effect is more noticeably potent when
SCP-2574 interacts with countries that were

00:07:19.449 --> 00:07:25.680
directly involved in the First World War,
increasing levels of civil unrest and discontentment

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:27.720
among the population.

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:32.440
These are often countered with worryingly
increased levels of police brutality, along

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:37.970
with governments enacting aggressive foreign
policies and sometimes antagonizing other

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:41.090
countries, as if they are eager to fight.

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:47.259
These effects don’t necessarily worsen the
closer SCP-2574 gets to a particular country

00:07:47.259 --> 00:07:52.150
but do seem to increase the more it approaches
its predicted destination.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:54.650
And where is that, you might ask?

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:59.900
The Foundation have calculated that, based
on SCP-2574’s trajectory since its emergence

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:06.420
back in 2012, the entity is heading for the
city of Sarajevo, the capital city of Bosnia

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.110
and Herzegovina.

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:14.729
What possible reason could SCP-2574 have for
wanting to venture towards this specific Bosnian

00:08:14.729 --> 00:08:15.729
city?

00:08:15.729 --> 00:08:20.430
Well, one cursory glance at the history of
Sarajevo will give you the answer: it’s

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:25.100
where the assassination of Archduke Franz
Ferdinand took place – the event commonly

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:28.909
attributed with starting the First World War.

00:08:28.909 --> 00:08:35.820
The transformative effects SCP-2574 has on
its surroundings began when the leonine leviathan

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:42.890
first appeared and commenced its journey towards
Sarajevo on December 24th, 2012.

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:48.270
Since then, the SCP Foundation has been closely
monitoring the sandstone creature’s movements,

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:52.560
and attempting to log all of the anomalous
effects it has had over the course of making

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:57.100
its way closer to the site of Fraz Ferdinand’s
assassination.

00:08:57.100 --> 00:09:04.200
Over five thousand kilometers away, to the
east of Kazakhstan’s capital, Astana, SCP-2574

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:07.649
caused an unusual World War One anomalous
effect.

00:09:07.649 --> 00:09:12.930
Any written works published in either Russian
or Kazakh began to randomly feature passages

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:14.730
from Irish poet W.B.

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:16.149
Yeats.

00:09:16.149 --> 00:09:21.019
These extracts from his body of work ranged
from single sentences to entire poems being

00:09:21.019 --> 00:09:26.019
featured in other writers’ publications,
regardless of author or genre.

00:09:26.019 --> 00:09:32.040
Yeats, for anyone unfamiliar, was widely considered
one of the greatest poets of the 20th Century.

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:37.420
However, unlike the authors of numerous poems
and songs to come out of the First World War,

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:38.420
W.B.

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:43.560
Yeats was never directly involved in the conflict
itself, and didn’t write much about it,

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:45.510
barring a few notable exceptions.

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:48.190
But more on him in a moment.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:53.190
When SCP-2574 approached Russia, things started
to escalate.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:58.130
Clouds of deadly chlorine gas – an early
World War One chemical weapon – began forming

00:09:58.130 --> 00:10:03.670
in rural areas throughout Europe, that couldn’t
be dispersed for days at a time.

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:08.680
As soon as the towering anomaly got close
enough, Russian military forces began launching

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:13.270
a series of drone strikes and aerial bombardments
targeting SCP-2574.

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:19.399
When these attacks failed, tensions mounted
with bordering countries, the situation only

00:10:19.399 --> 00:10:23.610
getting worse when it was discovered through
an intelligence leak that Russia was planning

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:26.430
a nuclear strike against the creature.

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:31.110
A move that likely could’ve spelled disaster
for the neighboring countries.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:37.140
SCP-2574, of course, sustained no damage,
and continued on its course.

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:42.740
Given that they couldn’t physically contain
SCP-2574, the Foundation was forced to think

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:46.490
outside the box when it came to coming up
with some kind of solution.

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:51.170
There were already too many eyewitnesses aware
of the leonine leviathan’s existence to

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:55.390
consider the administering of amnestics, even
on a large scale.

00:10:55.390 --> 00:11:02.300
The fact was, too many people already knowing
about SCP-2574 would make such a move pointless.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:09.170
The best that the Foundation could do to combat
– if not counteract – the effects of SCP-2574,

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:13.900
was to work directly with governments affected
by the creature’s World War One transformative

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:19.680
effects, to try and repair the damage left
in the anomaly’s wake, and ease the tension

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:21.830
and violence it caused.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:26.620
It became the Foundation’s job to deter
any country planning an armed military response

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:34.620
to the presence of SCP-2574, as any such strike
would endanger both their military and civilian

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:38.700
populations, while causing no damage to the
anomaly.

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:44.529
In the interest of trying to solve the problems
posed by SCP-2574 reverting parts of Europe

00:11:44.529 --> 00:11:50.320
to hellish First World War era battlefields,
the Foundation made a rare agreement to collaborate

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:57.140
with another large organization specializing
in the anomalous: the Global Occult Coalition.

00:11:57.140 --> 00:12:02.360
Working directly with the GOC, their goal
was to create a large-scale memetic countermeasure

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:09.430
that would effectively reset the toll SCP-2574
had exacted on global psychology, by altering

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:13.860
people’s temperaments and creating mass
political unrest as it progressed towards

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:15.550
the Bosnian capital.

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:21.579
However, given the tense history between the
SCP Foundation and the Global Occult Coalition,

00:12:21.579 --> 00:12:26.890
their attempts at creating a memetic countermeasure
are still ongoing, since neither group wants

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:31.019
the other to engage them in full-scale memetic
warfare.

00:12:31.019 --> 00:12:35.940
As such, the proposed countermeasure will
consist of two parts, with neither organization

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:39.459
being able to replicate the other’s half.

00:12:39.459 --> 00:12:45.149
Meanwhile, SCP-2574’s progress across Europe
was responsible for a number of other significant

00:12:45.149 --> 00:12:50.680
changes, physically, socially, and politically
recreating the conditions of the First World

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:51.680
War.

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:56.930
Poppies, a flower that has since become synonymous
with the remembrance of the conflict, began

00:12:56.930 --> 00:13:01.190
to grow in regions within Russia where they
wouldn’t naturally occur.

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:07.440
This included within urban locations, the
red flowers sprouting in and around buildings.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:12.310
As a result of such a high-profile anomaly
causing such widespread unrest to spread,

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:17.500
a number of religious cults centered around
SCP-2574 began to form.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:22.449
While the living descendants of World War
One veterans began suffering from vivid hallucinations

00:13:22.449 --> 00:13:27.420
that depicted their ancestor’s firsthand
experience of the fighting, these cults began

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:32.960
to amass more and more of those affected by
SCP-2574.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:37.760
The SCP Foundation was able to observe some
of the sermons delivered by these religious

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:45.890
cults, who appeared to view the public appearances
of SCP-2574 as signs of an impending apocalypse.

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:50.060
“Come to us and embrace your salvation!”

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:52.850
one cult leader exclaimed in a sermon.

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:58.300
“Discover the words of the prophet Yeats,
who spoke the sacred truth that all of history

00:13:58.300 --> 00:14:02.490
is a spiral, and that we have spiraled outwards
towards chaos!

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:06.670
Learn the true nature of the Second Coming!”

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:09.680
It appeared that some of these cults viewed
the poetry of W.B.

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:13.600
Yeats as prophetic in regards to SCP-2574.

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:19.540
They would often reference ‘The Second Coming’
which, interestingly, was the name of one

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:23.310
of his poems written in the aftermath of World
War One.

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:28.790
Yeats’ The Second Coming refers to a ‘rough
beast’ slouching towards Bethlehem.

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:33.839
The SCP Foundation has since uncovered some
erratic writings made by the poet before his

00:14:33.839 --> 00:14:39.459
death, that allude to Bethlehem, despite no
record existing of him ever traveling there.

00:14:39.459 --> 00:14:45.380
It is believed that Yeats somehow figured
out what SCP-2574 was, and that the closer

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:51.420
it gets to its destination, the more civilization
will spiral further out of control towards

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:54.370
total, all-consuming global chaos.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:59.560
Further research by the Foundation also uncovered
a testimony made by Gavrilo Princip – the

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:04.760
Serbian man responsible for assassinating
Archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austria and thus

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:07.079
sparking the First World War.

00:15:07.079 --> 00:15:13.200
Princip seems to have also had some knowledge
about SCP-2574, and apparently killed the

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:18.810
Archduke as a way to begin the creature’s
journey in order to make society more chaotic.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:25.300
With SCP-2574 progressing worryingly closer
to the site of Franz Ferdinand’s assassination,

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:28.190
further chaos rapidly began to spread.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:33.079
Anarchic sentiments took hold of most of Europe,
leading to an increased rate of violent encounters

00:15:33.079 --> 00:15:39.360
between civilians and police in many countries,
including Ireland, France, Great Britain,

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:45.110
and Italy, with a number of these experiencing
widespread rioting in their major population

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:46.110
centers.

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:52.680
Any government or political party compelled
by SCP-2574 to openly espouse the same anarchist

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:58.360
sentiments were soon seeing a rapid increase
in their public approval, gaining more popularity

00:15:58.360 --> 00:16:00.899
in polls than their opposition.

00:16:00.899 --> 00:16:06.350
As a result of these heightened tensions between
the public and the governments of their countries,

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:12.300
assassination attempts of politicians saw
an alarming increase of around sixty percent.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:18.770
SCP-2574 caused countries that had existing
hostile relations to engage in armed skirmishes

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:23.850
at their borders, with at least one of these
battles occurring every two weeks, and each

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:27.540
time, threatening to spark a much larger scale
conflict.

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:33.690
Thanks to the anomaly’s effects, the international
tensions, dissolving alliances between countries,

00:16:33.690 --> 00:16:37.990
and adoption of nationalism – which were
all factors leading to the start of the Great

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:41.950
War – were beginning to rapidly spread once
again.

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:47.890
By the time SCP-2574 was around five hundred
and fifty kilometers from Sarajevo, people

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:52.459
began to experience injuries common among
soldiers during World War One.

00:16:52.459 --> 00:16:58.269
Many patients would die during surgery, only
for their bodies to disappear shortly afterwards.

00:16:58.269 --> 00:17:05.560
Conflict erupted between Ireland and England,
and as SCP-2574 entered Bosnia and Herzegovina,

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:09.360
many began to report suffering intense dreams
about the anomaly.

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:14.610
A number of these reports seemed to state
that SCP-2754 was attempting to communicate

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:20.380
with them, and multiple websites began logging
the sandstone lion’s appearance in these

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:21.380
dreams.

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:27.110
And things will only get worse the closer
SCP-2574 gets Sarajevo.

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:33.580
SCP-2754 contains the raw energy of World
War One, one of the most catastrophic events

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:39.610
in human history, a global conflict with a
death toll in the tens of millions.

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:43.960
The SCP Foundation estimates it’ll reach
the site of Franz Ferdinand’s assassination

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.309
within a month.

00:17:45.309 --> 00:17:49.299
And from that point, given the effect it’s
had on the rest of Europe, there’s only

00:17:49.299 --> 00:17:56.570
